OL,3,ANoah Woods left playground through gap
OL,4,Ain fence, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Coroner's Court heard from
OL,7,Fpolice that Noah had left the
OL,8,Fplayground, walked into a memorial
OL,9,Fgarden and left that through an open
OL,10,Fgate. He then ran down a path on a new
OL,11,Fhousing estate towards the nearby Decoy
OL,12,FPond.
